## Review note — route-plan wrapper key strictness

During local review, `validateCapabilityRoutePlan()` was noted to validate the expected Capability Bus action wrapper fields and return a normalized route-plan copy containing only the accepted contract fields. It does not currently reject extra top-level wrapper keys on the input object.

This is non-blocking for this contract-only branch because extra wrapper keys are not propagated into the normalized route plan. A future hardening branch may tighten this to reject unknown wrapper-level keys if Michael wants stricter input-shape enforcement.

